        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n+------------------------------------------------------------------+\n|                    VENUS AT A GLANCE                             |\n+------------------------------------------------------------------+\n|                                                                  |\n|  Mass:       0.815 M⊕        Radius:   6,052 km (0.95 R⊕)      |\n|  Distance:   0.723 AU        Solar flux: 1.91× Earth            |\n|                                                                  |\n|  Surface T:  737 K (464°C)   Surface P:  92 bar                 |\n|  Greenhouse: +506 K          Albedo:     0.77 (Bond)             |\n|                                                                  |\n|  Rotation:   -243.0 days     Day length: 116.75 Earth days       |\n|  (retrograde — clockwise when viewed from above north pole)      |\n|                                                                  |\n|  Magnetic field: NONE        Ionosphere: YES (induced by SW)     |\n|  Plate tectonics: None (stagnant lid?)                           |\n|  Moons: 0                                                        |\n+------------------------------------------------------------------+\n```"
    },
