        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Venus: Runaway Greenhouse and Cautionary Tale",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Altitude (km)   Layer              Temperature   Feature\n  -------------   -----              -----------   -------\n  > 100 km        Thermosphere       ~300 K+        Solar UV absorption\n  85-100 km       Mesosphere (cold)  ~170 K         Coldest region\n  70-80 km        Upper cloud deck   ~230-250 K     H₂SO₄ aerosols\n  48-70 km        Middle/lower clouds ~300-400 K    Thick H₂SO₄ clouds\n  32-48 km        Middle troposphere  ~400-600 K    Hazy; some aerosols\n  0-32 km         Lower troposphere   600-737 K     Dense CO₂; IR opaque\n  Surface         Basaltic plains     737 K          Crushing pressure"
    },
