        "title": "Venus: Runaway Greenhouse and Cautionary Tale",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "KEY FEATURE: The clouds are at 48-70 km altitude\n    → They make Venus super-reflective (high albedo)\n    → But CO₂ below traps all IR → massive greenhouse\n    → Albedo and greenhouse work AGAINST each other;\n       greenhouse wins spectacularly\n```"
    },
