      "text": "```\nCOMPOSITION BY VOLUME (lower atmosphere)\n=========================================\n  CO₂:     96.5%\n  N₂:       3.5%\n  SO₂:     ~150 ppm   (volcanic; also forms H₂SO₄)\n  Ar:       ~70 ppm\n  H₂O:     ~30 ppm   (very low — key to the divergence from Earth)\n  CO:       ~17 ppm\n  H₂SO₄ (clouds): not a gas in the lower atmosphere but dominant aerosol"
