      "text": "MOIST GREENHOUSE (moderate)            RUNAWAY GREENHOUSE (catastrophic)\n--------------------                   ----------------------------\n  Water vapor is a forcing agent         Water vapor feedback overwhelms\n  CO₂ drives primary warming            CO₂ + H₂O feedback becomes unstable\n  Feedback amplifies warming             Entire ocean vaporizes into atmosphere\n  BUT: oceans remain liquid              No liquid water remains\n  Temperature increases modestly         Temperature → thousands of K\n  EXAMPLE: Current Earth                 EXAMPLE: What Venus probably experienced"
